OVERVIEW: Start a server, or a whole project.

USAGE: portly start [<server>] [--project <project>] [--json] [--api-port <api-port>]

ARGUMENTS:
  <server>                Server name or id. Use "project/server" to
                          disambiguate.

OPTIONS:
  --project <project>     Act on every server in this project instead.
  --json                  Print raw JSON instead of a human summary.
  --api-port <api-port>   Override the control API port.
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

Port 9396 is free.
